      "content": "Reasons for High Tropical Biodiversity"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Tropical regions have remained relatively undisturbed by glaciations for millions of years, allowing uninterrupted evolutionary diversification.",
        "Tropical environments are less seasonal, more constant, and predictable, which fosters high niche specialisation.",
        "Higher availability of solar energy in the tropics directly contributes to greater productivity and species richness."
      ],
      "id": "gd7yvgy"
    },
